sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User
    participant Splash as 📱 SplashPage
    participant Landing as 📋 LandingPage
    participant Detail as 🔍 DetailPage
    participant Service as ⚙️ BreedsService
    participant Http as 🌐 HttpClient
    participant API as 🐱 TheCatApi (/v1/breeds)
    participant Cap as 🔌 Capacitor (Native)

    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    %% Phase 1: App Launch & Splash Screen Flow
    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note over User, Cap: Phase 1: Application Boot & Splash Screen
        User->>Cap: Launch Mobile Application
        Cap->>Cap: Display OS Launch Screen
        Cap->>Splash: Bootstrap Angular & Mount SplashPage
        Splash->>Cap: SplashScreen.hide() (Hide OS Splash)
        Splash->>User: Display Brand Splash ("Catbreeds" + Cat Illustration)
        
        par Background API Pre-fetch
            Splash->>Service: loadBreeds()
            Service->>Http: GET /v1/breeds (Header: x-api-key)
            Http->>API: HTTP Request to api.thecatapi.com
            API-->>Http: 200 OK (Breeds JSON payload)
            Http-->>Service: Observable / Signal emit
            Service-->>Service: Store breeds in Reactive State
        and Splash Timer Delay
            Splash->>Splash: Wait 2000ms (Smooth Brand Exposure)
        end

        Splash->>Landing: Router.navigate(['/home'], replaceUrl: true)
    end

    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    %% Phase 2: Landing Page & Search / Filter Flow
    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 249, 255)
        Note over User, API: Phase 2: Landing Page & English Breed Search
        Landing->>Service: breedsSignal() / getBreeds()
        Service-->>Landing: Return Cached Breeds List
        Landing->>User: Render Breed Cards Grid (Name, Image, Origin, Intelligence, "Más...")

        User->>Landing: Type in Search Bar (e.g. "Abyssinian" / "Bengal")
        Landing->>Landing: Filter breeds by name (in English)
        alt Matches Found
            Landing->>User: Display Filtered Breed Cards
        else No Matches Found
            Landing->>User: Display Empty State ("No breeds found")
        end
    end

    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    %% Phase 3: Detail View & Half-Scroll Interaction
    %% ---------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(250, 245, 255)
        Note over User, Detail: Phase 3: Breed Detail & Fixed Image with Scroll
        User->>Landing: Tap Card or "Más..." button
        Landing->>Detail: Navigate to /detail/:id (Pass Breed Data)
        
        Detail->>User: Render Screen Layout:<br/>• Header: Breed Name & Back button ("<")<br/>• Top 50%: Fixed Hero Image (Non-movable)<br/>• Bottom 50%: Scrollable Container
        
        User->>Detail: Scroll bottom half of the screen
        Detail->>User: Reveal Extended Details:<br/>• Description (Variable length)<br/>• Origin Country<br/>• Intelligence Rating<br/>• Adaptability Rating<br/>• Life Span (Years)

        User->>Detail: Tap Back Button ("<")
        Detail->>Landing: Router.navigateBack()
        Landing->>User: Restore Landing Page with Active Search State
    end

